 with specific activities for Scouts and Webelos.\nKlondike involves chal
 lenge stations designed to test the Scouts’ knowledge of skills ranging
  from first aid to problem solving\, and everything in between. But the g
 reater challenge is to dress and prepare for whatever the weather offers.
